# `runtime.list_procs`

List the daemon's tracked child processes (agents, executors).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.runtime.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `slug` | `string` |
| `kind` | `string` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`ListProcsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `processes` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call runtime.list_procs --json '{ "slug": "", "kind": "", "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "processes": [
    {
      "pid": 12345,
      "slug": "checkout-flow-a1b2c3d",
      "pipeline_run_id": "job-checkout-flow-a1b2c3d",
      "step_id": "implement",
      "cmd": "claude-code --agent rust-lane",
      "executor_kind": "agent",
      "spawned_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
      "exited_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
      "exit_code": 0,
      "signals_sent": [],
      "status": "exited"
    }
  ]
}
```
